# Stack

- Next.js App Router + TypeScript (`src/`). Deploy: Vercel.
- Supabase: Auth, Postgres, Storage, Realtime. No Express/Nest/Firebase.
- UI: Tailwind + shadcn/ui. No CSS-in-JS.
- Validation: Zod. Forms: React Hook Form.
- Types for DB: `supabase gen types`. Do not hand-write table row types.

# Folders

See `placement.mdc` for import-graph placement. Top level:

```
src/app/                 # Next routes only (page, layout, loading)
src/features/listings/   # ui/ units + queries/actions
src/features/chat/
src/features/auth/
src/features/profile/
src/components/ui/       # shadcn only
src/lib/supabase/        # browser client, server client, middleware
supabase/migrations/     # SQL only
```

- Feature code stays in `src/features/<name>`. Do not dump domain logic in `src/app`.
- Inside a feature: `ui/{unit}/index.tsx`, not loose components at the feature root.
- Server Components by default. `"use client"` only for chat, filters, forms.
- Mutations: Server Actions in the same feature folder. No random `/api` unless webhook/cron.
- Listing expiry: Supabase scheduled function or cron route. Do not expire only in the UI.
